                            <keyword start="1496069/25s" duration="10400/2500s" value="192 always kind of liked not having to pick an outfit every morning. i’ll miss that."/>
                            <keyword start="1496173/25s" duration="17200/2500s" value="194 scored so many dirty looks when he was with me in uniform. some people didn’t like the age gap."/>
                            <keyword start="299269/5s" duration="5500/2500s" value="195 that sucks."/>
                            <keyword start="59856s" duration="12700/2500s" value="196 are you... hooking up with anyone at the moment?"/>
