                            <keyword start="1496662/25s" duration="7900/2500s" value="199 no. (then) just, like, the new ones. by accident. i didn’t want to."/>
                            <keyword start="1496741/25s" duration="5100/2500s" value="200 sure, you just happened to bring up your ‘age gap’ then?"/>
                            <keyword start="1496792/25s" duration="7900/2500s" value="201 well yeah, i was talking about me and ned. what are you talking about?"/>
