                            <keyword start="1086506/25s" duration="13900/2500s" value="077 nothing... it’s about olivia."/>
                            <keyword start="217328/5s" duration="25600/2500s" value="079 when mrs. kennedy is unavailable, you know i’m your next port of call. whatever you need to tell her..."/>
                            <keyword start="1086886/25s" duration="8300/2500s" value="080 i don’t want to make a big deal of it."/>
                            <keyword start="1086968/25s" duration="11200/2500s" value="081 olivia may have called to say she’s okay, but she’s obviously still going through a difficult time."/>
                            <keyword start="1087079/25s" duration="7000/2500s" value="082  any information you have could help us help her. "/>
                            <keyword start="1087148/25s" duration="6100/2500s" value="083 i think she might be in some kind of trouble. "/>
                            <keyword start="1087197/25s" duration="4700/2500s" value="084 what kind of trouble?"/>
                            <keyword start="217447/5s" duration="13300/2500s" value="085 i found out she’s been seeing someone she shouldn’t be, "/>
                            <keyword start="1087354/25s" duration="8000/2500s" value="086 like secretly. i think they’re older."/>
                            <keyword start="217486/5s" duration="3700/2500s" value="087 okay..."/>
                            <keyword start="1087462/25s" duration="8500/2500s" value="088 i saw her get into a car. (beat) it was mr muggleton’s."/>
                            <keyword start="217509/5s" duration="11900/2500s" value="089 i’m not saying they’re definitely hooking up - but with everything she’s told me... i’m freaking out."/>
                            <keyword start="1087651/25s" duration="14400/2500s" value="090 you’ve done the right thing. if something inappropriate is going on, the school needs to know"/>
                            <keyword start="1087776/25s" duration="12900/2500s" value="091 don’t worry, i’ll take care of it"/>
                            <keyword start="1087902/25s" duration="14700/2500s" value="092 yashvi nods, troubled"/>
                        </mc-clip>
